# ==============================================================================
# NagrikSetu AI — Backend Environment Configuration (.env)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Twilio SMS Gateway Credentials (For Real Phone OTP & Grievance SMS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Obtain these from your Twilio Console: https://console.twilio.com/
# Example:
#   Account SID starts with 'AC...'
#   Auth Token is a 32-character secret hex string
#   Phone number must include country code with '+' (e.g., +15017122661)

TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=your_twilio_account_sid_here
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_twilio_auth_token_here
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1234567890
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Google Gemini API Key (For Zero-Shot Reasoning & Vision AI)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Obtain from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. SMTP Email Configuration (Optional - for Email Dockets)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=your_gmail_app_password
